  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ZcashOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Zcash -- the first cryptocurrency using zk-SNARKs for transaction privacy, enabling fully shielded (private) or transparent transfers. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with optional cryptographic privacy. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add read-only Zcash block CQL adapter and developer walkthrough (d2bc604)\n- Return real Zcash keys and Stacks c32check addresses (a679a74)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ZcashOASIS",
